+ *           | { u64 tick, u32 code, u32 arg }[50]
+ *   2048:   'S','W','E','E','T','P','A','N' | u32 code | u32 arg | u32 pid
+ *           | u64 thread | u64 pc | u64 tick | u64 sp | u8 saved_state[272]
