+ * device-tree node that carries the property: the tree node resolves to an
+ * IOPlatformDevice and is not offered as an IOService, so the property-match
+ * lookup returns "none" and backboardd stops its display set-up before drawing
+ * anything (NOTES 14:09, re-confirmed round 471).
